{
  "id": "OfS9aAEK",
  "slug": "pocket-happy-ghast-re-enchanted",
  "title": "Pocket Happy Ghast Re-enchanted",
  "description": "Adds a beautiful ghast to your inventory",
  "body": "<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/35f87c5da306c6dc385ae71645cf5c0eca3ccee0.png\" alt=\"📕 Discription 📕\" width=\"432\" height=\"72\">\n\nWhen installed, this resource pack adds a cute **little happy ghast** to your inventory that will fly around there, saving you from loneliness.\n\nGhast is added to the inventory menu in both survival and creative modes.\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/745ce5ea2438055fcc617cf48dff3cca0578b7b7.png\" alt=\"🔧 Installation 🔨\" width=\"450\" height=\"72\">\n\n1. Download the resource pack\n2. Drop it into the resourcepacks folder\n3. Download Mods: **Animatica & OptiGUI**\n4. Download Resource pack: **Default Dark Mode**\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b43cc796761cde86eeb47949ab4ea8c878fbadec.png\" alt=\"❗❗ Requirements ❗❗\" width=\"504\" height=\"72\">\n\nTo use the resource pack, you will need the **Animatica** mod.\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/animaticarefabricated\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f8e931553d2e781bf8bea338c78813ad09c6e02.png\" alt=\"Animatica Required Install\"></a>\n\nYou will also need the **OptiGUI** mod.\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e57e2855fe2689d5bfce5f9925cd00b7f0f8606e.png\" alt=\"OptiGUI Required Install\"></a>\n\nIt is also advisable to have the **Default Dark Mode** resource pack for proper display.\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/default-dark-mode\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/06727d5026bb183081decbb1f659546474fb4c61.png\" alt=\"Default Dark Mode Required Install\"></a>",
